The project is coded only using plan files with the extension ".plan".
The root path for plan files is: C:\Users\predo\source\repos\Alignerr\allbsr\BE Plans
The root file for the generated source code is: C:\Users\predo\source\repos\Alignerr\allbsr\BE

Plan files syntax
# = represents a comment line and is not to be taken into consideration.
executed = is written alone on a single line, and each line after this keyword is ignored and will not be taken into consideration. The scope of the executed keyword ends when it reaches the not_executed keyword or reaches the end of the file.
not_executed = is written alone on a single line, and each line that follows must be taken into consideration. The scope of the not_executed keyword ends when it reaches the executed keyword or reaches the end of the file.

While reading and executing the .plan file, do not print back the file content.
Follow the plan file syntax
